# Runtime Data (incident DB, generated reports)
# `data/*` rather than `data/` so the benchmark evidence cited by the TDD and
# the roadmap can be un-ignored below — git does not descend into an excluded
# directory, so a negation inside `data/` would never be reached.
data/*
!data/benchmarks/
data/benchmarks/*
!data/benchmarks/*.json
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
